lt=\"Mastodon\" width=\"99\" height=\"20\"></a>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbsky.app%252fprofile%252faether-mod.net\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://custom-icon-badges.demolab.com/badge/bluesky-@aether--mod--net-green?logo=cloud&amp;logoSource=feather&amp;style=flat-square&amp;color=0085ff\" alt=\"\" width=\"179\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.threads.net%252f%2540devaether\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://custom-icon-badges.demolab.com/badge/threads-devaether-green?logo=instagram-threads&amp;style=flat-square&amp;color=000000\" alt=\"\" width=\"133\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.facebook.com%252fAetherMod\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/facebook-AetherMod-blue?logo=facebook&amp;style=flat-square&amp;color=1877F2&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"145\" height=\"20\"></a>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/devaether-instagram?color=D50060&amp;label=instagram&amp;logo=instagram&amp;style=flat-square&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.tiktok.com%252f%2540devaether\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/@devaether-tiktok?color=000000&amp;label=tiktok&amp;logo=tiktok&amp;style=flat-square&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"135\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@DevAether\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/youtube-@DevAether-blue?color=FF0000&amp;label=youtube&amp;logo=youtube&amp;style=flat-square\" alt=\"\" width=\"151\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/theaetherteam\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitch/status/theaetherteam?logo=twitch&amp;style=flat-square&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"103\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.reddit.com%252fr%252fTheAether%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/TheAether-reddit?color=FF4500&amp;label=reddit&amp;logo=reddit&amp;style=flat-square&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"127\" height=\"20\"></a>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252faether.wiki.gg%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://custom-icon-badges.demolab.com/badge/wiki.gg-aether-green?logo=wikigg&amp;style=flat-square&amp;color=FF1980\" alt=\"\" width=\"111\" height=\"20\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>🔨 關於此擴充模組 🔨<br></strong></span></h2><p>寶藏重鑄擴充模組允許你將<strong>多餘的地城戰利品回收</strong>，轉換成不同的裝備。這需要透過使用新的<strong>鍛造模板</strong>，並結合從熔煉某些裝備中獲得的<strong>獨特材料</strong>來達成。</p><p>海神裝備可分解成<strong>海神網格</strong>，女武神裝備可分解成<strong>女武神錠</strong>，鳳凰裝備則可分解成<strong>烈焰錠</strong>。你甚至可以將太陽祭壇分解成<strong>烈焰碎片</strong>，這些碎片可以用黑曜石重新合成為烈焰錠，或用來重新點燃黑曜石盔甲。女武神錠和烈焰錠甚至可以製造成新的壓縮方塊。</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/The-Aether-Team/.github/6371b821b24e43cf2fbc18f9405edef2bfe87e92/images/treasureReforging0.png\" width=\"1588\" height=\"854\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h2><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>☁️ 來自遺忘之穹團隊的更多作品 ☁️</strong></span></h2><p>如果你對這個擴充模組有任何疑問，或者只是想了解遺忘之穹團隊開發的其他項目，歡迎加入遺忘之穹Discord伺服器！我們友好的工作人員和熱情的社區將確保您在這裡有賓至如歸的感覺！</p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/aethermod\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/The-Aether-Team/.github/main/images/image4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"282\" height=\"102\"></a></p><p>你也可以透過在Patreon上贊助來支持遺忘之穹團隊！每一筆贊助都直接投入到開發中，使我們能夠繼續從事我們最熱愛的事業。<a href=\"https://patreon.com/TheAetherTeam\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/The-Aether-Team/.github/main/images/image3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"434\" height=\"102\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
